      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1080709216,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The next amendment of the DoIP standard changes the version (without changing header layout) and is expected to arrive later this year or early next year. With the dissector stopping dissection on unknown versions, this would lead to problems with Wireshark 4.0. So cherry picking this fix avoids problems for users later.",
